    "completion_requirement": "Passing requires CPU regression completion, trace comparison, and the public-port checks of the halt request and machine counters. The fixed tree builds and runs every program with the reference module, so after only the target is replaced a build failure, a missing target module, an RTL simulation that does not complete (including the fixed RVFI cycle limit and assertions) and a comparison mismatch are FAIL. Missing fixed tools or inputs, resource exhaustion and wall-clock timeouts are INVALID."
